# Repos where block-push-to-main.sh enforces the guardrail. One repo name per
# line, matched against the `origin` remote's repo name — so it applies across
# worktrees and Superset workspaces, which live at unrelated paths.
# Every repo NOT listed here is unaffected; `#` comments and blanks ignored.
#
# Concentro repos keep the PR flow (see the Git section of ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md):
# main moves only through a reviewed PR, never a direct push.
woodrow
api
# folio-platform also vendors this hook in its own .claude/settings.json, but
# that copy only loads when the session's project IS folio-platform. Listing it
# here covers a session started in woodrow or api that pushes there.
folio-platform
